id=tunnel_server
name=Scrcpy Multi-Session Tunnel
version=v2.2
versionCode=2
author=yzy806806
description=QUIC tunnel (TLS 1.3 + PSK) for scrcpy-based remote control, plus a resident virtual-display holder so apps keep running on the controlled device after the controller disconnects. Holder needs a real output surface and DEVICE_DISPLAY_GROUP (SurfaceFlinger mirroring requires it), so keep the device awake while it is in use.
